20
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,280
Hmm?

21
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:35,280
Ah, will you be my girlfriend?

22
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,280
Huh?

23
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:52,920
But for me, the problem is something else, a roadblock most people will never have to

24
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,280
face.

25
