It didn't take too long to realize something has changed in the back of my mind.

26
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:10,080
Your eyes, there ain't nowhere left to hide behind.

27
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:14,740
Time no longer flew like it was when the flash froze everything before.

28
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:18,960
Without you, I don't know if I could take this road.

29
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,480
And I'm about to lose my mind.

30
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,700
Every minute that I'm down back in time.

31
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,860
Every single day, it's just three wines.

32
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:28,580
Some physical pain in this side drive.

33
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:32,500
All the hardest and the smiles never faded.

34
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:35,040
I know you'll be by my side when we make it.

35
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:37,580
Come back from the dead.

36
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,960
Back in time.

37
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:44,420
Die back in time.

38
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:48,800
Die back in time.

39
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,040
Die back in time.

40
00:02:53,040 --> 00:03:10,380
Die back in time.

41
